@startuml
title Multi domain orchestration with the dynamic orchestration function

box "Marketplace Owner"
participant "Product Order\nCapture and\nvalidation" as OrderCapture
participant "Product Order\nDelivery &\nOrchestration" as OrderOrch
participant "AI driven Intent\nbased\nOrchestration" as AIOrch
participant "Party\nManagement" as PartyMgmt
participant "Service catalog\nManagement" as ServiceCatalog
participant "Resource Inventory\nManagement" as ResourceInv
participant "Service Order\nManagement" as ServiceOrder
participant "Product Inventory" as ProductInv
end box

box "Business Partner = Gaming vendor"
participant "Service Order\nManagement" as GamingServiceOrder
participant "Product Inventory" as GamingProductInv
end box

box "Business Partner = MEC Provider"
participant "Service Order\nManagement" as MECServiceOrder
participant "Product Inventory" as MECProductInv
end box

OrderCapture -> OrderOrch : TMF 622: Submit\nProduct Order - POST
OrderOrch -> OrderOrch : Int: Order Ack.\nand start decomp
OrderOrch -> AIOrch : TMF???: Determine\nBusiness partner\nbased on need
AIOrch -> AIOrch : Apply criteria to order
AIOrch -> PartyMgmt : TMF 632: fetch Partner\nmatching the criteria
PartyMgmt --> AIOrch : Consume partner(s)
AIOrch -> AIOrch : Select partner
AIOrch --> OrderOrch : Consume\nBusiness Partner\nID
OrderOrch -> OrderOrch : Apply Partner ID\nas PS attribute
OrderOrch -> ServiceCatalog : TMF 633: Get mapping CFSS (and RS)
ServiceCatalog --> OrderOrch : Consume response (CFSS / RFSS and RS)
OrderOrch -> OrderOrch : Decompose POLI into Service\nand Resource Order(s)
OrderOrch -> ResourceInv : TMF 716: POST Reserve / Allocate MSISDN and IMSI / SUPI
ResourceInv -> ResourceInv : Reserve resources for the\nResource Order
ResourceInv --> OrderOrch : Consume the Resources
OrderOrch -> ServiceOrder : TMF 641: POST - Service Order for the allocated MSISDN, IMSI / SUPI and 5G Core Data Service
ServiceOrder -> ServiceOrder : Trigger 640 for the\nService Activation
ServiceOrder --> OrderOrch : Activation success
OrderOrch -> GamingServiceOrder : TMF 641: POST - Service Order for the gaming SW
GamingServiceOrder -> GamingServiceOrder : Trigger 640 for App Activation
GamingServiceOrder -> GamingProductInv : TMF 637: POST Create PI Instance for the SW License
GamingProductInv --> GamingServiceOrder : Success Ack
GamingServiceOrder --> OrderOrch : Activation success with License Key
OrderOrch -> ServiceOrder : TMF 641: POST Pair MSISDN / IMSI to SW App license key
ServiceOrder -> ServiceOrder : Trigger 640 to activate/pair\nlicense key on MSISDN
ServiceOrder --> OrderOrch : Success Ack
OrderOrch -> ServiceOrder : TMF 641: POST Activate Service on 5G slices on 5G core
ServiceOrder -> ServiceOrder : Decompose to n CFSS and\ntrigger 640(s) to activate service on eMBB, MMTC and uRLLC
ServiceOrder --> OrderOrch : Activation is success
OrderOrch -> ServiceOrder : TMF 641: POST Activate service on 5G slices on 5G edge
ServiceOrder -> ServiceOrder : Decompose to n CFSS
ServiceOrder -> MECServiceOrder : TMF 641: POST Activate service on 5G slices at edge (one each for the 3 5G slices)
MECServiceOrder -> MECServiceOrder : Decompose and trigger TMF 640 in loop for the\nactivation of the resources on all 3 CFSS, RFSS and RS
MECServiceOrder -> MECProductInv : (activation loop)
MECProductInv --> MECServiceOrder : Success Ack
MECServiceOrder --> ServiceOrder : Activation success for 5G slices
ServiceOrder --> OrderOrch : Activation success
OrderOrch -> ProductInv : TMF 637: Post Product Inventory Instance
ProductInv --> OrderOrch : Success Ack
OrderOrch --> OrderCapture : TMF 622: POST Update\nOrder status
@enduml
